### Get all tasks
GET http://localhost:9000/tasks?

### Get task by id
GET http://localhost:9000/tasks/2

### Create a new task
POST http://localhost:9000/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Task title",
    "description": "Task description",
    "deadline": "2025-02-12"
}

### Delete task
DELETE http://localhost:9000/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Task 3",
    "description": "Task 3 description"
}

### Update task
PUT http://localhost:9000/tasks/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Task 2 updated",
    "description": "Task 2 description updated",
    "completed": true
}